<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Telecom, Spain's Telefonica say sign deal.</title>
<headline>Portugal Telecom, Spain's Telefonica say sign deal.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal Telecom said it signed an accord with Spain's Telefonica de Espana, which included a share swap.</p>
<p>Telefonica will take 3.5 percent of Telecom, while the Portuguese company will take a one percent stake in Telefonica.</p>
</text>
